'''Emissaries''' are [[NPC]]s scattered across the {{zone|Dwarven Mines}} and also in the {{zone|Crystal Nucleus}}.

== Mechanics ==
'''Emissaries''' appear in a location once the player reach [[Commissions|Commissions Milestone I]]. They grant access to the [[Commissions#Interface|Commissions Menu]] that can otherwise be accessed through the [[King]], [[Royal Pigeon]] or {{NPCSprite|Queen Mismyla}}‘s [[Abiphones#Contacts|{{Aqua|Abiphone Contact}}]].

