== Trivia ==
* '''Emissary Sisko''' is most likely a reference to [[fandom:memory-alpha:Benjamin_Sisko|Benjamin Sisko]], the protagonist of Star Trek: Deep Space Nine, who also held the title of Emissary to the Prophets.
* 

